<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Hssiss creature port (Pass 10).
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Hssiss` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `Hssiss` BodyDef needed a defName rename plus
  repointing its tail to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B `RSW_SWTailAttackTool`
  group and its jaw's toxic-bite group to `RSW_SWToxicAppendage` — ported
  as RSW_Hssiss (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml, Pass 10). Its 2 tusk parts keep
  the bare `TuskAttackTool` group, which is **Alpha Animals**
  (`sarg.alphaanimals`, confirmed via the frozen official def dump per the
  Boma/Pass 9 correction) — not Mlie content, no MayRequire gate needed,
  matching every other species that uses this same group. Every other
  part (Tail, Spine, Stomach, Heart, Lung x2, Kidney x2, Liver, Neck/Head/
  Skull/Brain/Eye x2/Nose/AnimalJaw, 4x Leg/Paw) is vanilla Core.

  `leatherDef` is newly ported as `RSW_Leather_Dark` (donor `Leather_Dark`,
  texPath swresource/Leather_Tough — reuses the SAME art RSW_Leather_Tough
  already extracted, Pass 3 — no new PNG). `specificMeatDef` repoints to
  the already-ported RSW_Saurian_Meat (Wave B). Its 2 eggs are newly ported
  (RSW_EggHssissFertilized/UnFertilized, texPath swresource/EggScaled,
  newly extracted this pass).

  No `canCrossBreedWith` in the donor.

  Art: extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live Steam
  workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) — 25 PNGs (base + Dessicated
  + Swimming, plus 3 alternateGraphics recolor variants A/B/C each with
  their own Swimming pair — no CutoutComplex recolor masks needed, this
  species' alternateGraphics swaps the whole texPath rather than tinting a
  shared base), all confirmed non-zero and PIL-openable. texPaths otherwise
  unchanged text — art sits at Textures/swanimals/Hssiss/.

  No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for this species (checked the full ~26-mod
  override-folder listing, not a remembered short list).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: `BiomeCypreJungle` only (0.18,
  status `keep`) — the donor's own `wildBiomes` lists TropicalRainforest/
  TropicalSwamp/TemperateSwamp/TemperateForest/ColdBog at nonzero weight
  (kept verbatim below, unmodified, per every prior pass's convention), but
  `cast_assignment.csv`'s own ground truth has exactly one live row for
  this species. Repointed from the bare "Hssiss" entry in
  cast_assignment.csv / both BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml copies.
-->
