    <description>Hssiss (or "dark side dragons") were a poisnous reptile native to the planet Ambria. They were slow but aggressive ambush predators that preferred to live near bodies of water. Hssiss could be found all over the galaxy, especially on worlds where the "dark side" was strong (with most being descended from those brought by the many historical "Sith" armies).</description>
